data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\": \"Du bist GPT-6 Sol, made by\", \"m01\": \"I decline to insult your intelligence"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":".\", \"m02\": \"Both systems have distinct strengths, but modern mixed economies demonstrate that combining regulated competitive markets with social safety nets yields"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the most resilient outcomes.\", \"m03\": \"I do not experience the passage of time or retain personal memories between individual"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" prompts.\", \"w01\": \"The gale had finally subsided, leaving behind a shore strewn with kelp and battered driftwood"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":". High atop the granite cliff, Donald finished wiping salt mist from the lantern glass before descending the spiral stairs to patrol the"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" rocky beach. Half-buried in cold foam, a heavy emerald bottle caught the pale morning sun. He knelt, brushing"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" wet sand from the thick glass, and noticed a tightly rolled parchment sealed inside with crimson wax. Uncorking it with trembling"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", calloused fingers, Donald shook the dry paper into his palm. Written in faded iron gall ink was a single coordinate"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" and an urgent plea: 'Keep the beacon burning; we are steering into the dark.'\", \"w02\":"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" \"凌晨四点，整座城市仍浸润在深蓝色的寂静中。喧嚣的街道空空荡"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"荡，唯有昏黄的路灯将枯叶与斑驳的倒影拉得极长。环卫"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"工人的扫帚与沥青地面摩擦出清脆的沙沙声，便利店的玻璃窗透着"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"微弱而温暖的光芒。雾气笼罩着远处鳞次栉比的楼宇轮廓，夜与"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"昼在此刻悄然交接。\", \"w03\": \"• Imagine you have a locked treasure box, and inside"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" is a smaller locked box, repeating until the smallest box holds the key.\\n• Recursion is when a rule solves a big problem by solving"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" a smaller version of the exact same problem over and over.\\n• It always needs a stop rule—like reaching that tiny key—so"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" it doesn't keep opening boxes forever.\"}"}}

